{"schema_version":1,"type":"work","title":"金小史","authors":[{"name":"楊循吉","role":"撰","entity_id":"hixhd2h9be9y"}],"indexed_by":[{"source":"千頃堂書目","source_bid":"d59f2mel8d1c","title_info":"楊循吉金小史八卷","summary":"楊循吉金小史八卷"}],"description":{"text":"楊循吉撰。八卷。見著錄於《千頃堂書目》。其著錄之文，《千頃堂書目》作「楊循吉金小史八卷」。本書惟《千頃堂書目》一志著錄，別無他證。《千頃堂書目》清黃虞稷撰——本書之目賴之以存。","sources":["千頃堂書目"]},"juan_count":{"number":8},"measures":[{"unit":"卷","number":8}],"measure_info":"八卷","period_upper":"qing","period_upper_basis":"catalog_bound：唯一著錄源《千頃堂書目》成書於清初（黃虞稷 1629-1691），故不晚於 qing；書內小注無朝代線索，period 留 null 不猜","ai_note":"撰人切分來源：又條承上。","id":"d59f6eoyupz4","revision":"1.0.1","revised_at":"2026-09-07","resources":[{"name":"维基文库","type":"text","id":"wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%87%91%E5%B0%8F%E5%8F%B2"}],"has_text":true,"_path":"Work/p/z/4/d59f6eoyupz4-金小史.json","_isDraft":false}